# Receipts for OCR testing (CLOUDAPPG5-102).
#
# Real purchase receipts carry names, addresses and partial card numbers, so
# they must not reach a shared repository. Drop your own samples in this folder
# to run tests against them locally; git ignores everything here except the
# sanitised ones listed below, which we commit deliberately.
#
# Adding a sample for everyone? Check it has no personal data, then add a
# `!` line for it here in the same PR.

*
!.gitignore
!jib-receipt.jpg
